# Changes to policy, workflows and templates change who can approve what and
# what runs with production credentials. CODEOWNERS requests review from every
# listed team but is satisfied by ANY one of them: the ruleset on main adds a
# required-reviewers rule for config/issueops.json so platform-admins,
# ai-governance AND finops-approvers must each approve policy changes.
*                                   @CoolEngOrg/platform-admins
/config/issueops.json               @CoolEngOrg/platform-admins @CoolEngOrg/ai-governance @CoolEngOrg/finops-approvers
/.github/workflows/                 @CoolEngOrg/platform-admins
/.github/actions/                   @CoolEngOrg/platform-admins
/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/            @CoolEngOrg/platform-admins
/.github/validator/                 @CoolEngOrg/platform-admins
/internal/tmpl/templates/           @CoolEngOrg/platform-admins
/deploy/                            @CoolEngOrg/platform-admins @CoolEngOrg/platform-ai
/cmd/agent-runner/                  @CoolEngOrg/platform-ai
